From d94b64b8f8e1335246cce01d8b799a2fea7d9634 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:53:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 31/34] bcm2835-sdiod: probe the Pi 3B+ Wi-Fi chip over SDIO

GPIO 34-39 to the Arasan controller (the SD card stays on sdhost),
power-cycle through rpi-firmwared's wifi_power, SDIO card init (CMD5,
CMD3, CMD7), CCCR and CIS, function 1, the ALP clock, and the ChipCommon
chip ID over CMD52 and CMD53, also at 25 MHz on four data lines. Prints
the results and exits; no network interface yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
